extends layout.pug

block content

  nav.nav
    a(href='/')
      span &larr;
      |  Back

  article.portfolio-about
    .inner-wrapper.flex-row-wrap.two-col
      .about-intro-box.box

        //- Replace with your name
        h1 Fabiola Gonzalez

        //- Feel free to personalize the title below
        p Full Stack JavaScript Developer

        .about-bio
          //- Replace the boilerplate below with your best elevator pitch
          p I'm a software engineer with a background in design, operations, and leadership. After more than a decade of managing teams and creative projects, I transitioned into software development to combine my passion for problem-solving with my interest in technology.

          p Through my past experiences at Ada Developers Academy, Anita B. Pathways, and my software engineering internship at Khan Academy, I've gained experience building applications, collaborating with engineers, and developing user-centered solutions.

          p I enjoy working across the stack, with a particular interest in backend development, and bring creativity, empathy, and a collaborative mindset to every project.


      .skills-contact-box.box
        h6 Skills

        //- Replace skills below with your own skills — at this point, you should be able to list as many as ten skills
        ul
          li HTML
          li CSS
          li JavaScript
          li Python
          li React
          li Git and GitHub
          li VS Code
          li Accessibility
          li OOP
          li Fetch and Public APIs
          li Node.js
          li Express
          li Pug

        h6 Contact Info

        //- Replace with your own contact info - feel free to use fake information if you prefer
        ul
          li gonzalezfabs@gmail.com

        //- Add URLs to the hrefs below to link to your social media accounts - feel free to use non-personal links to social media home pages if you prefer
        a.btn-link(href='https://www.linkedin.com/in/gonzalezfabiola') LinkedIn
        a.btn-link(href='https://www.github.com/fabi01a') GitHub

    nav.nav
      a(href='/')
        span &larr;
        |  Back